stic, laboratory, and clinical data of ivermectin-mebendazole as adjunctive, combination therapy in patients undergoing conventional cancer care. Methods. PubMed, Europe PMC and Google Scholar were searched through October 2026 for peer-reviewed in vitro, in vivo, and human studies of ivermectin and mebendazole in malignant disease, supplemented by oncology meeting abstracts, reference-list screening of prior reviews and ClinicalTrials.gov records. Mechanisms were counted at the level of distinct molecular ta", "title": "Combination Ivermectin and Mebendazole: A Comprehensive Review of Anticancer Mechanisms, Preclinical Activity, and Clinical Evidence as Adjunctive Treatment in Cancer Patients"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVjeC39w", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 590, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8895754, "raw_content": "", "author": "rdvs34283", "created": 1792490901898, "profile_picture": "p9HQtdiLq2uP", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "NotYourMan", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "thefederalist.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVjeC39w.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://thefederalist.com/2026/10/19/media-break-out-fiery-but-mostly-peaceful-playbook-to-downplay-frances-islamo-marxist-riots/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Media Break Out \u2018Fiery But Mostly Peaceful\u2019 Playbook To Downplay France\u2019s Islamo-Marxist Riots", "last_comment_created": 1792510965009, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 590, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator